{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "hdr-audio-tracks",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Audio Tracks\n\nSource audio goes on these tracks. Here is where you will edit audio clips and do channel specific effects.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 150
    },
    {
      "id": "hdr-vcas",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## VCAs\n\nUse VCAs to automate groups of faders from scene to scene",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 150
    },
    {
      "id": "hdr-fx-channels",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FX channels\n\nDedicated aux channels for reverb, futz, and other effects",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 150
    },
    {
      "id": "hdr-group-buses",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Group Buses\n\nUse a bus to check levels of each group and apply group effects",
      "x": 1220,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 150
    },
    {
      "id": "hdr-prints",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Prints\n\nUse as source for printing stems. Do not put any effects on these channels, as the signal will be recorded pre-inserts.",
      "x": 1620,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 170
    },
    {
      "id": "hdr-sub-master",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Sub Master\n\nUse to check levels of overall mix and apply mix effects (Limiting, etc.)",
      "x": 2080,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 150
    },
    {
      "id": "hdr-print-master",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Print Master\n\nUse as source for printing final mix and for monitoring. Do not put any effects on this channel, as the signal will be recorded pre-inserts.",
      "x": 2540,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 170
    },
